 "meta_desc": "Fichas de Matemáticas I (1.º de Bachillerato): ecuaciones de la recta, vector director y normal, posiciones relativas, ángulos, distancias y mediatriz. 100 ejercicios.",
 "key_big": "Ax + By + C = 0: normal (A, B)",
 "key_sub": "d = |Ax₀ + By₀ + C| / √(A² + B²)",
 "body_html": "<h2>Cómo se hace</h2><p>Una recta queda determinada por un punto P(x₀, y₀) y un <b>vector director</b> v = (v₁, v₂): (x, y) = (x₀, y₀) + t·(v₁, v₂).</p><p>En la ecuación <b>general</b> Ax + By + C = 0, el vector (A, B) es <b>normal</b> a la recta y (−B, A) es director. La pendiente es m = −A/B.</p><p>Distancia de P(x₀, y₀) a Ax + By + C = 0: d = |Ax₀ + By₀ + C| / √(A² + B²).</p><p>Rectas paralelas: misma pendiente. Perpendiculares: m · m′ = −1.</p><div class='qfig'><svg data-pf='lg' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 280 280' width='280' height='280' role='img' aria-label='plano cartesiano'><g font-family='Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif'><line x1='20.0' y1='260.0' x2='20.0' y2='20.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='20.0' y1='260.0' x2='260.0' y2='260.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='44.0' y1='260.0' x2='44.0' y2='20.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='20.0' y1='236.0' x2='260.0' y2='236.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='68.0' y1='260.0' x2='68.0' y2='20.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='20.0' y1='212.0' x2='260.0' y2='212.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='92.0' y1='260.0' x2='92.0' y2='20.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='20.0' y1='188.0' x2='260.0' y2='188.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='116.0' y1='260.0' x2='116.0' y2='20.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='20.0' y1='164.0' x2='260.0' y2='164.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='140.0' y1='260.0' x2='140.0' y2='20.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='20.0' y1='140.0' x2='260.0' y2='140.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='164.0' y1='260.0' x2='164.0' y2='20.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='20.0' y1='116.0' x2='260.0' y2='116.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='188.0' y1='260.0' x2='188.0' y2='20.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='20.0' y1='92.0' x2='260.0' y2='92.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='212.0' y1='260.0' x2='212.0' y2='20.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='20.0' y1='68.0' x2='260.0' y2='68.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='236.0' y1='260.0' x2='236.0' y2='20.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='20.0' y1='44.0' x2='260.0' y2='44.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='260.0' y1='260.0' x2='260.0' y2='20.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='20.0' y1='20.0' x2='260.0' y2='20.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='20.0' y1='140.0' x2='268.0' y2='140.0' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2.2'/><line x1='140.0' y1='260.0' x2='140.0' y2='12.0' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='44.0' y='159.0' font-size='16' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>−4</text><text x='127.0' y='242.0' font-size='16' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>−4</text><text x='92.0' y='159.0' font-size='16' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>−2</text><text x='127.0' y='194.0' font-size='16' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>−2</text><text x='188.0' y='159.0' font-size='16' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>2</text><text x='127.0' y='98.0' font-size='16' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>2</text><text x='236.0' y='159.0' font-size='16' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>4</text><text x='127.0' y='50.0' font-size='16' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>4</text><text x='266.0' y='132.0' font-size='17' font-weight='700' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle' font-style='italic'>x</text><text x='152.0' y='18.0' font-size='17' font-weight='700' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle' font-style='italic'>y</text><line x1='68.0' y1='260.0' x2='188.0' y2='20.0' stroke='#1565c0' stroke-width='3.4'/><line x1='44.0' y1='20.0' x2='260.0' y2='128.0' stroke='#c62828' stroke-width='3.4'/></g></svg></div><div class='sn-ex'><span class='sn-ex-t'>Ejemplo</span><p class='sn-ex-q'>Recta por (1, 2) con v = (3, −1)</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>−x − 3y + C = 0</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>C = 7</p><p class='sn-ex-a'>Respuesta: x + 3y − 7 = 0</p></div><div class='sn-ex'><span class='sn-ex-t'>Ejemplo</span><p class='sn-ex-q'>Distancia de (2, 1) a 3x + 4y − 5 = 0</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>|6 + 4 − 5| / 5</p><p class='sn-ex-a'>Respuesta: 1</p></div><h2>Errores frecuentes</h2><div class='sn-tw'><table class='sn-table'><thead><tr><th>Error frecuente</th><th>Qué hacer</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Confundir director y normal</td><td>(A, B) es normal; (−B, A) es director.</td></tr><tr><td>Olvidar el valor absoluto</td><td>Una distancia nunca es negativa.</td></tr><tr><td>Perpendicular con la pendiente opuesta</td><td>Es −1/m, no −m.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
